#  Q-Diagnose — Hybrid Quantum-Classical Disease Detection Platform
#  SIH 2026 · Team QuantWarriors
#
#  TRACKED (clone + follow SETUP.md → fully working):
#    ✓  backend/          — FastAPI Python source
#    ✓  features/         — Feature engineering pipeline
#    ✓  frontend/src/     — React source
#    ✓  frontend/package.json, vite.config.js, index.html
#    ✓  mocks/            — Contract-shaped JSON fixtures
#    ✓  contracts/        — Interface contracts
#    ✓  config.yaml       — Platform configuration
#    ✓  requirements.txt  — Python deps
#    ✓  data/demo/        — Demo CSVs (breast_cancer, heart_disease, diabetes, parkinsons)
#    ✓  README.md, SETUP.md
#
#  NOT TRACKED:
#    ✗  Python venvs
#    ✗  node_modules
#    ✗  User-uploaded datasets (data/uploads/)
#    ✗  Experiment artifacts (artifacts/)
#    ✗  SQLite databases
#    ✗  Python bytecode
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

